##### q14: What percentage of 2024 race laps had a TrackStatus of exactly '1'? Count every race lap row.
== run 1 ==
  step 1 SQL: SELECT COUNT(*) AS total_laps, SUM(CASE WHEN TrackStatus='1' THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS status1_laps FROM laps WHERE session='R';
  step 2 SQL: SELECT 24604.0/26606*100 AS pct;
steps=2 ANSWER: "Out of all 26\u202f606 race‑lap rows in the 2024 season, 24\u202f604 had a `TrackStatus` of exactly `'1'`.  \nThat is **92.48\u202f%** of the race laps."
